# discomplemented.com

## Domain Configuration
- **Production URL:** https://discomplemented.com
- **Staging URL:** https://bicameral-staging.workers.dev
- **DNS Provider:** Cloudflare (nameservers)
- **Hosting:** Cloudflare Workers

## Setup Instructions
See `docs/dns-setup.md` for complete DNS configuration guide.

## Quick Start
```bash
# After purchasing/transfering domain to Cloudflare:
wrangler deploy --env production

# Custom domain will be automatically configured on first deploy.
# Verify with: curl -I https://discomplemented.com/api/health
```
